act1_varkyr 3:     #Challenge tradition and test the limits of this initiation.
act1_varkyr 2:         Defiance flares in your veins as you meet the Matriarch's gaze. A murmur ripples through the court—few dare question her, yet fascination flickers in those predatory eyes. You vow to forge your own path, even if it means courting exile or worse.
