act1_varkyr 6: The Matriarch returns to her throne, her expression grave.
act1_varkyr 6: 
act1_varkyr 6: "Veilfall teeters on the edge of chaos. The Lupines grow bold, encroaching on territories they once feared to enter. The Forsaken multiply in the shadows, Caius the Unbound gathering an army of hybrids. And whispers speak of the Ecliptic Amulet—an artifact of immense power, said to control the very Veil that separates our world from mortal awareness."
act1_varkyr 6: 
act1_varkyr 6: She pauses, letting the weight of her words settle.
act1_varkyr 6: 
act1_varkyr 6: "Three factions seek this amulet. The Lupines believe it can end the curse of the moon, granting them control over their transformations. The Forsaken think it will stabilize their hybrid forms, ending their suffering. And we..."
act1_varkyr 6: 
act1_varkyr 6: Her smile is cold and terrible.
act1_varkyr 6: 
act1_varkyr 6: "We know its true purpose. The Ecliptic Amulet doesn't just manipulate the Veil—it can [i]shatter[/i] it. Or reinforce it eternally. Whoever controls the amulet controls the fate of all supernatural beings."
