act1_varkyr 6: The Matriarch leans forward, her gaze piercing.
act1_varkyr 6: 
act1_varkyr 6: "I offer you a choice, Knight. A choice that will define your path forward."
act1_varkyr 6: 
act1_varkyr 6: "You may serve the Crimson Spire as a loyal agent—following our directives, hunting the amulet for Varkyr interests, ensuring our faction emerges dominant. In return, you will have our full resources, our protection, our favor."
act1_varkyr 6: 
act1_varkyr 6: "Or," she continues, "you may operate independently—pursuing the amulet for your own reasons, making your own alliances, forging your own path. You will still be acknowledged as Varkyr, but you will not have our backing when politics turn dangerous."
act1_varkyr 6: 
act1_varkyr 6: "Or finally," her smile turns dangerous, "you may [i]oppose[/i] us. Seek to claim the amulet for another faction, or destroy it entirely. This path leads to exile—or execution—but some believe freedom is worth any price."
act1_varkyr 6: 
act1_varkyr 6: The court is utterly silent. Even the torches seem to still their flickering.
act1_varkyr 6: 
act1_varkyr 6: This is the moment that will define everything.
