varkyr_abilities 0: [b]PROGENITOR - The Apex of Vampiric Existence[/b]
varkyr_abilities 0: 
varkyr_abilities 0: You have transcended mortal comprehension. All abilities from Commoner through Imperial are yours by birthright. Additionally, the following unique powers manifest:
varkyr_abilities 0: 
varkyr_abilities 0: *set genesis_rebirth true
varkyr_abilities 0: *set celestial_dominion true
varkyr_abilities 0: *set primordial_sanguine_surge true
varkyr_abilities 0: *set cosmic_damnation true
varkyr_abilities 0: 
varkyr_abilities 0: • [b]Genesis Rebirth[/b] - Resurrect from a single drop of blood
varkyr_abilities 0: • [b]Celestial Dominion[/b] - Command the stars themselves
varkyr_abilities 0: • [b]Primordial Sanguine Surge[/b] - Blood magic beyond reality's limits
varkyr_abilities 0: • [b]Cosmic Damnation[/b] - Curse that warps space-time
varkyr_abilities 0: 
varkyr_abilities 0: You are not merely powerful. You [i]are[/i] power.
varkyr_abilities 0: 
varkyr_abilities 0: *goto apply_varkyr_abilities
varkyr_abilities 0: 
varkyr_abilities 0: *comment ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
varkyr_abilities 0: *comment SUBROUTINES
