varkyr_abilities 0: 
varkyr_abilities 12: *label record_selection
varkyr_abilities 12: *params ability_name
varkyr_abilities 12: 
varkyr_abilities 12: *if (abilities_selected = 0)
varkyr_abilities 6:     *set ability_choice_1 ability_name
varkyr_abilities 6:     *set abilities_selected +1
varkyr_abilities 6:     *goto record_selection_done
varkyr_abilities 6: 
varkyr_abilities 6: *if (abilities_selected > 0)
varkyr_abilities 6:     *set ability_choice_2 ability_name
varkyr_abilities 6:     *set abilities_selected +1
varkyr_abilities 6: 
varkyr_abilities 12: *label record_selection_done
varkyr_abilities 12: *return
varkyr_abilities 0: 
varkyr_abilities 6: *label apply_varkyr_abilities
varkyr_abilities 6: *line_break
varkyr_abilities 6: 
varkyr_abilities 6: *if (rank = "Progenitor")
varkyr_abilities 0:     The transformation is complete. You stand as the pinnacle of vampiric evolution—the [b]Progenitor Reborn[/b].
varkyr_abilities 6: 
varkyr_abilities 6: *if (rank != "Progenitor")
varkyr_abilities 6:     You have mastered [b]${ability_choice_1}[/b] and [b]${ability_choice_2}[/b].
varkyr_abilities 6: 
varkyr_abilities 6:     The blood remembers. These powers are yours eternally.
varkyr_abilities 6: 
varkyr_abilities 6: *comment Update unlocked_abilities tracking string
varkyr_abilities 6: *if (rank != "Progenitor")
varkyr_abilities 6:     *set newly_unlocked " "
