act1_mage 7: The portal deposits your team on the rocky shore of Mirror Lake. The moon hangs bloated and red above—echoes of the old Pact rituals. Tonight, the lake's surface ripples upward, as if reality itself is trying to climb out.
act1_mage 7: 
act1_mage 7: Archmage Selene stands at the center of a spinning ward circle, hands raised. Spellblade Imani Grey guards her flank, silvered blade humming with runes. Arcanist Tamsin Reed kneels beside a mirrored bowl, eyes distant as she reads the Veil's currents.
act1_mage 7: 
act1_mage 7: Selene doesn't look away from her work. "Apprentice, this is not a drill. Something is pulling at the Veil from beneath the lake. We hold, or Veilfall floods with horrors."
