act1_forsaken_ng+ 8: The catacombs beneath Veilfall swallow all sound, their narrow passages thick with the scent of damp stone and lingering death. This is 123 Street Underground—one of the Forsaken's primary gathering places, hidden beneath the poorest quarter of the city.
act1_forsaken_ng+ 8: 
act1_forsaken_ng+ 8: You descend stone stairs worn smooth by centuries of footfalls. Each step takes you deeper into the realm of outcasts and hybrids—beings rejected by both Varkyr and Lupine alike.
