act1_forsaken_ng+ 8: The underground chamber opens before you—a cathedral carved from living rock. Hundreds of Forsaken fill the space, their features a disturbing blend of vampire and wolf. Some have fangs and fur. Others possess blood-red eyes and lupine claws. Each is unique. Each is an abomination in the eyes of the pure bloodlines.
act1_forsaken_ng+ 8: 
act1_forsaken_ng+ 8: At the center, atop a raised platform of ancient stone, stands Caius the Unbound.
act1_forsaken_ng+ 8: 
act1_forsaken_ng+ 8: He is the first. The original Forsaken—created during the Millennium War when a Varkyr and Lupine bloodline were forcibly merged through dark ritual. Where others show unstable features, Caius is perfect: vampire grace and lupine power seamlessly combined.
act1_forsaken_ng+ 8: 
act1_forsaken_ng+ 8: His voice carries without shouting. "Brothers. Sisters. Children of two bloodlines and heirs to neither."
act1_forsaken_ng+ 8: 
act1_forsaken_ng+ 8: The crowd falls silent.
act1_forsaken_ng+ 8: 
act1_forsaken_ng+ 8: "We gather tonight because the time of hiding is ending. The Lupines and Varkyrs war over scraps of territory while treating us as vermin. But we are not vermin. We are the [i]future[/i]."
act1_forsaken_ng+ 8: 
act1_forsaken_ng+ 8: *choice
