origin_varkyr 0: *comment VARKYR ORIGIN - Fledgling of the Crimson Spire
origin_varkyr 0: *comment ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
origin_varkyr 0: 
origin_varkyr 1: *label crimson_spire_initiation
origin_varkyr 1: 
