origin_forsaken 2: Caius extends his hand. "Welcome to the Forsaken. You are hated by the world above. Down here, you are [i]kin[/i]."
origin_forsaken 2: 
origin_forsaken 2: Other Forsaken approach—some offering nods, others wary but curious. You are one of them now.
