origin_forsaken 2: 
origin_forsaken 2: Over the next nights, Caius teaches you the basics:
origin_forsaken 2: 
origin_forsaken 2: "Varkyrs will see you as corrupted. Lupines will see you as tainted. Humans will see you as double-threat. All will try to kill you."
origin_forsaken 2: 
origin_forsaken 2: He shows you how to shift—not just between human and hybrid form, but how to suppress your Varkyr or Lupine traits to pass among each faction.
origin_forsaken 2: 
origin_forsaken 2: "Subterfuge is survival. But never forget: you are not lesser than them. You are [i]more[/i]."
origin_forsaken 2: 
origin_forsaken 2: He gestures to the tunnels. "The Forsaken Enclave is your sanctuary. But you cannot hide forever. Eventually, you must walk the surface. Face the factions. Prove we deserve to exist."
origin_forsaken 2: 
