forsaken_abilities 0:         #Twilight Veil
forsaken_abilities 0:             [i]Merge shadow and moonlight for perfect concealment.[/i]
forsaken_abilities 0: 
forsaken_abilities 0:             By channeling both vampiric darkness and lunar radiance, you become nearly invisible—supernatural senses detect only a shimmer, like heat haze under moonlight.
forsaken_abilities 0:             *gosub record_ability "Twilight Veil"
forsaken_abilities 0:             *goto selection_complete
forsaken_abilities 0: 
