forsaken_abilities 0:         #Hybrid Regeneration
forsaken_abilities 0:             [i]Heal using blood OR moonlight—whichever is available.[/i]
forsaken_abilities 0: 
forsaken_abilities 0:             Your dual nature grants flexibility: consume blood like a Varkyr or bask in moonlight like a Lupine to accelerate healing. Both methods work, giving you options pure-bloods lack.
forsaken_abilities 0:             *gosub record_ability "Hybrid Regeneration"
forsaken_abilities 0:             *goto selection_complete
forsaken_abilities 0: 
