forsaken_abilities 0:             [i]Temporary apotheosis—become the living eclipse.[/i]
forsaken_abilities 0: 
forsaken_abilities 0:             Once per lunar cycle, you can channel the full might of both bloodlines for 10 minutes. During this time, you rival Archduke Varkyrs and Alpha Prime Lupines in raw power. The exhaustion afterward is catastrophic.
