origin_assassin 1: "Silver. The only substance that truly harms Lupines. But use it as a last resort. The Whispering Pines Pack is led by Alpha Rurik—a black-furred titan with more honor than most nobles and more fury than a wildfire. If you draw blood first, you won't leave those woods alive."
origin_assassin 1: 
origin_assassin 1: He taps the map. "The farmsteads are here, at the forest's edge. The pack's main territory is deeper in. Approach openly. Announce yourself. If they grant you parley, you may survive."
