act1_lupine 5:     *if (lupine_enhanced_senses) #Use Enhanced Senses to read their intentions
act1_lupine 0:         Your lupine senses flare—you smell fear, curiosity, respect in their scents. You hear the subtle shift of muscle, the quickening heartbeats. They're testing you, not hunting you.
act1_lupine 0: 
act1_lupine 0:         You growl softly, acknowledging their presence without challenging. Several wolves lower their heads in return.
