act1_lupine 2:         *gosub_scene rank_progression gain_xp 10 "Retreated strategically"
act1_lupine 2:         *goto_scene act1_chapter1 report_back
act1_lupine 5:     #Pull out a weapon to defend yourself.
act1_lupine 1:         With a swift motion, you unsheathe your weapon, the steel gleaming under the moonlight. The wolves grow tense, their growls resonating through the silent forest. Yet, amidst the tension, a white-furred wolf, a rare sight signifying a special status, steps forward with a calming aura, seemingly offering a chance for peaceful interaction.
