act1_lupine 1: The alpha wolf, with his black fur shimmering in the moonlight, approaches you. His eyes scrutinize you for a moment before he nudges his head, acknowledging your status as an Omega - the lowest rank within their hierarchy but a part of the pack nonetheless. The rest of the wolves, with their fur of brown, gray, and the occasional white, encircle you, their forms shifting into that of humans as they welcome you into their realm.
