act1_lupine 2:         #"What's stopping you from finding it?"
act1_lupine 0:             Rurik's expression darkens. "It's hidden. Guarded by ancient magic. And we are not the only ones searching. The Varkyrs want it. The Forsaken want it. Even humans have begun to stir, their hunters seeking weapons against us."
act1_lupine 0: 
