act1_lupine 2: 
act1_lupine 2: "I am telling you this," Rurik continues, "because I sense you have a role to play in what comes. Whether with the pack or apart from it, you will be involved."
act1_lupine 2: 
act1_lupine 2: He stands, shaking out his fur.
act1_lupine 2: 
act1_lupine 2: "The hunt for the Ecliptic Amulet has already begun in secret. Agents move through Veilfall, searching for clues. The Crimson Spire sends its Knights. Caius the Unbound rallies his Forsaken. And we…"
act1_lupine 2: 
act1_lupine 2: His grin turns feral.
act1_lupine 2: 
act1_lupine 2: "We hunt as we always have—with tooth and claw and packmates at our flanks."
act1_lupine 2: 
