act1_lupine 1:     "You are pack now," Rurik says firmly. "That means the pack's mission is your mission. You will hunt the amulet for Lupine interests. You will ensure our people gain freedom from the moon's tyranny."
act1_lupine 1: 
act1_lupine 1:     He pauses, studying you.
act1_lupine 1: 
act1_lupine 1:     "But I am not the Matriarch. I do not demand blind obedience. If you believe another path is right, speak. We decide as pack."
