origin_noble 1: Night drapes the Ravencrest estate in velvet shadow. Servants whisper of screams, of blood pooling beneath your father's study door. House guards refuse to enter until you arrive. The air smells of iron and incense-a Varkyr calling card.
origin_noble 1: 
origin_noble 1: Your father's seal-a raven clutching a crescent moon-glints on the study door. The crest of House Ravencrest now rests on [i]your[/i] shoulders whether you asked for it or not.
