origin_noble 0:         *set will +5
origin_noble 0:         *goto spire_offer
origin_noble 0: 
origin_noble 1:     #"House Ravencrest bends knee to no vampire."
origin_noble 0:         Isabella smiles, sharp. "Then bend to extinction? The Night Council already circles. Choose quickly."
origin_noble 0: 
origin_noble 0:         *set will +10
origin_noble 0:         *goto spire_offer
origin_noble 0: 
origin_noble 1:     #"We negotiate. House Ravencrest still has value."
origin_noble 1:         "Clever," she purrs. "Perhaps you'll survive longer than your sire."
origin_noble 1: 
origin_noble 1:         *set cunning +5
origin_noble 1:         *goto spire_offer
