origin_noble 1: 
origin_noble 1: Isabella's proposal is simple: accept the Embrace and secure your house under Spire protection-or refuse and risk annihilation from enemies you cannot see. The Ecliptic Amulet's human shard is in play; nobles without supernatural backing will be pawns at best.
origin_noble 1: 
origin_noble 1: *choice
origin_noble 1:     #Accept the Embrace to claim power
origin_noble 0:         Cold fangs pierce your wrist. Fire floods your veins, burning away mortality.
