act1_human 1:         If the public knew about vampires and werewolves, humanity could mobilize.
act1_human 1: 
act1_human 1:         "Panic," Vale says flatly. "Chaos. Witch hunts that kill innocent humans along with guilty monsters. The Veil is a cage—but it protects [i]us[/i] as much as it hides [i]them[/i]."
act1_human 1: 
