act1_human 2: "Your first assignment," Vale continues, "is an investigation. Three incidents in the past week—all connected."
act1_human 2: 
act1_human 2: He produces a map of Veilfall, marking three locations with red ink.
act1_human 2: 
act1_human 2: "First: A merchant found drained of blood in an alley. Varkyr feeding ground."
act1_human 2: 
act1_human 2: "Second: A farmer's livestock slaughtered, torn apart by claws. Lupine hunting party."
act1_human 2: 
act1_human 2: "Third: Witnesses report a creature with both fangs and fur attacking near the docks. Forsaken."
act1_human 2: 
act1_human 2: "Three factions. Three incidents. But I suspect [i]one[/i] orchestrator. Someone is stirring up supernatural activity—perhaps to find something. Or hide something."
