act1_human 2: "Captain Thorne?" Elena's voice is shocked. "You're supposed to be dead."
act1_human 2: 
act1_human 2: Thorne smiles coldly. "I faked my death six months ago. While Vale plays politics with monsters, I've been building something [i]real[/i]. A purge. I've been staging these attacks to provoke war between the factions. When they slaughter each other, humanity will be free."
