act1_human 2: "The Ecliptic Amulet. An artifact of immense power, said to control the Veil itself. Thorne believed that if he found it, he could use it to expose all supernatural beings to humanity—shattering the Veil permanently."
act1_human 2: 
act1_human 2: Your blood runs cold. "That would mean war. Total war."
